### Iniciar sesión
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prop3@example.com",
  "contrasena" : "banana"
}

### Cerrar sesión
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout

### Agregar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "propietario 3",
  "email": "prop3@example.com",
  "contrasena" : "password",
  "numero_telefonico": "2461568789"
}

### Reset password
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prop3@example.com"
}

###Set new password
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/reset-password/eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjksImlhdCI6MTczMTAzMTQxMiwiZXhwIjoxNzMxMDM1MDEyfQ.lb-Sf3p9GNpjl3n-4HGxYZ9zkA6ywDT0YHNpsC935N4
